Veil is built on Omarchy's own lock screen plugin, omarchy.lock
(https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy, `shell/plugins/lock/`, as shipped in
Omarchy 4.5.0). Service.qml, FingerprintModel and poster.sh carry its code
largely unchanged - the session lock, both PAM flows, the fingerprint retry
model, the blank timer and the IPC surface - and LockView.qml keeps its
password field. It is used here under the same MIT license:

